sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Timer as Worker Timer
    participant Worker as Expiry Worker
    participant Service as Booking Lifecycle Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Timer->>Worker: tick every 30 seconds
    Worker->>Worker: skip if previous tick is running
    Worker->>Service: expireBatch(limit = 100, now)
    Service->>DB: BEGIN
    Service->>DB: SELECT expired RESERVED rows<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    DB-->>Service: disjoint locked batch

    loop Each claimed booking
        Service->>DB: UPDATE RESERVED -> EXPIRED
        alt Transition won
            Service->>DB: restore ticket inventory
            Service->>DB: release RESERVED voucher quota
            Service->>DB: append status history
        else Already terminal / lost race
            Service->>Service: no release and no duplicate history
        end
    end

    Service->>DB: COMMIT
    Service-->>Worker: processed count
    Worker->>Worker: emit metric and structured log

    Note over Service,DB: Row locks, lifecycle transition, resource release,<br/>and audit history share one transaction.
